{"id":12059,"artist":"da 'La Boheme' di G.Puccini","title":"Vecchia zimarra, senti","lyrics_plain":"Vecchia zimarra, senti,\nio resto al pian,\ntu ascendere il sacro\nmonte or devi.\nLe mie grazie ricevi.\nMai non curvasti il logoro\ndorso ai ricchi ed ai potenti.\nPassar nelle tue tasche\ncome in antri tranquilli\nfilosofi e poeti.\nOra che i giorni lieti fuggir,\nti dico: addio,\nfedele amico mio\nAddio, addio!","lyrics_synced":"[00:03.38] Vecchia zimarra, senti,\n[00:09.59] io resto al pian,\n[00:13.29] tu ascendere il sacro\n[00:18.10] monte or devi.\n[00:24.11] Le mie grazie ricevi.\n[00:31.86] Mai non curvasti il logoro\n[00:41.32] dorso ai ricchi ed ai potenti.\n[00:46.93] Passar nelle tue tasche\n[00:54.48] come in antri tranquilli\n[01:00.76] filosofi e poeti.\n[01:07.13] Ora che i giorni lieti fuggir,\n[01:13.72] ti dico: addio,\n[01:20.30] fedele amico mio\n[01:27.81] Addio, addio!","lyrics_synced_enhanced":"[00:03.38] <00:03.38>Vec <00:04.35>chia <00:04.76>zi <00:05.25>mar <00:06.18>ra, <00:07.13>sen <00:08.14>ti,\n[00:09.59] <00:09.59>io <00:10.12>res <00:10.62>to al <00:11.15>pian,\n[00:13.28] <00:13.28>tu <00:15.25>ascen <00:16.14>de <00:16.63>re <00:17.12>il sa <00:17.61>cro\n[00:18.10] <00:18.10>mon <00:18.57>te or <00:19.09>de <00:20.15>vi.\n[00:24.10] <00:24.10>Le <00:24.68>mie <00:25.24>gra <00:26.38>zie <00:26.93>ri <00:27.55>ce <00:28.68>vi.\n[00:31.85] <00:31.85>Mai <00:33.75>non <00:35.13>cur <00:35.70>vas <00:37.55>ti <00:39.44>il lo <00:40.33>go <00:40.77>ro\n[00:41.32] <00:41.32>dor <00:42.20>so <00:43.10>ai ric <00:43.55>chi <00:44.02>ed ai <00:44.49>po <00:44.98>ten <00:45.98>ti.\n[00:46.92] <00:46.92>Pas <00:48.76>sar <00:50.67>nel <00:51.49>le <00:51.98>tue <00:52.47>tas <00:53.43>che\n[00:54.47] <00:54.47>co <00:55.93>me in <00:56.48>an <00:57.42>tri <00:57.83>tran <00:58.37>quil <00:59.58>li\n[01:00.76] <01:00.76>fi <01:01.25>lo <01:01.71>so <01:02.22>fi e <01:02.76>po <01:03.27>e <01:04.34>ti.\n[01:07.13] <01:07.13>O <01:08.08>ra <0